      text: `<p></p> <p>Indexes are auxiliary access structures used to increase the speed of record retrieval in response to certain search conditions.<br/><br/>Based on knowledge about indexes, which of the following statements is/are correct?<br/> </p> <p></p>`,
      image: "",
