        `\\( W_{\\mathbf{i+1}} = \\max \\{ W_{\\mathbf{i}},\\; W_{\\mathbf{i}} + w(x_{\\mathbf{i+1}}) \\} \\) <br/>`,
        `\\( W_{\\mathbf{i+1}} = \\max \\{ W_{\\mathbf{i-1}},\\; W_{\\mathbf{i}} + w(x_{\\mathbf{i+1}}) \\} \\) <br/>`,
        `\\( W_{\\mathbf{i+1}} = \\max \\{ W_{\\mathbf{i}},\\; W_{\\mathbf{i-1}} + w(x_{\\mathbf{i+1}}) \\} \\) <br/>`,
