      text: `<p></p> <p>Let \\(\\mathrm{F}, \\mathrm{G}, \\mathrm{H}\\) be three atomic propositions.<br/> What is the relation between propositions \\(\\mathrm{P}\\) and \\(\\mathrm{Q}?\\) <br/> <span class="mjx-chtml MJXc-display" style="text-align: center;"></span> \$\$ \\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{P: (F} \\wedge \\text{G}) \\Rightarrow \\text{H} \\\\ &amp; \\text{Q: F} \\Rightarrow(\\text{G} \\Rightarrow \\text{H}) \\end{aligned} \$\$ </p> <p></p>`,
