      text: `<p></p> <p>Suppose that \\(\\left\\{S_1, S_2, \\ldots, S_N\\right\\}\\) is a set of fixed-length strings ordered alphabetically so that \\(S_1&lt;S_2 &lt; \\ldots S_N.\\) If these strings are held, in order, in an array of \\(N\\) elements, then the time required to find the location of \\(S_{i+1}\\), given the location of \\(S_i, 1\\leq i &lt; N\\) is </p> <p></p>`,
