        `The number of occurrences of the label \\('i'\\) in the Prüfer code is one less than the degree of the vertex \\('i'\\) in the original tree.`,
        `Prüfer code of tree \\(\\text{T}\\) has distinct values in all positions if and only if \\(\\text{T}\\) is a path graph.`,
      ],
