      type: "MSQ",
      text: `<p></p> <p>Consider the following circuit (assume all flip-flops are \\(D\\) flip flops and all are positive edge triggered): </p> <p style="text-align:center"><img alt="" height="206" src="js/questions/fst-mock-test-2/16.png" width="382"/></p> <p> In the following table, Show the values of the indicated signals at each time step. The clock is shown on the top line of the table, and the initial values are shown in the first column.<br/> <span class="mjx-chtml MJXc-display" style="text-align: center;"></span> \$\$ \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|} \\hline \\text{Clk} &amp; 0 &amp; 1 &amp; 0 &amp; 1 &amp; 0 &amp; 1 &amp; 0 &amp; 1 \\\\ \\hline \\hline \\mathrm{A} &amp; 1 &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline \\mathrm{B} &amp; 0 &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline \\mathrm{C} &amp; 0 &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline \\mathrm{D} &amp; 1 &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline \\end{array} \$\$<br/> Which of the following is/are correct sequence of values for each signal, starting from the first column in the given table: </p> <p></p>`,
