      neg: 0,
      type: "MSQ",
      text: `<p></p> <p> \\(\\textsf{GoClasses}\\) professor has designed an assignment with three semaphore-synchronized processes running simultaneously in an interleaved fashion on a single CPU. </p> <p> \\(\\textsf{P1:}\\) </p> <pre class="prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp prettyprinted" data-pbcklang="c_cpp" data-pbcktabsize="4" style=""><ol class="linenums"><li class="L0"><span class="pln">wait</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">s1</span><span class="pun">);</span></li><li class="L1"><span class="pln">wait</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">s2</span><span class="pun">);</span></li><li class="L2"><span class="kwd">print</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="str">"1"</span><span class="pun">);</span></li><li class="L3"><span class="pln">signal</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">s2</span><span class="pun">);</span></li><li class="L4"><span class="pln">signal</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">s1</span><span class="pun">);</span></li></ol></pre> <p> \\(\\textsf{P2:}\\) </p> <pre class="prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp prettyprinted" data-pbcklang="c_cpp" data-pbcktabsize="4" style=""><ol class="linenums"><li class="L0"><span class="pln">wait</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">s2</span><span class="pun">);</span></li><li class="L1"><span class="pln">wait</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">s3</span><span class="pun">);</span></li><li class="L2"><span class="kwd">print</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="str">"2"</span><span class="pun">);</span></li><li class="L3"><span class="pln">signal</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">s3</span><span class="pun">);</span></li><li class="L4"><span class="pln">signal</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">s2</span><span class="pun">);</span></li></ol></pre> <p> \\(\\textsf{P3:}\\) </p> <pre class="prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp prettyprinted" data-pbcklang="c_cpp" data-pbcktabsize="4" style=""><ol class="linenums"><li class="L0"><span class="pln">wait</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">s2</span><span class="pun">)</span></li><li class="L1"><span class="pln">wait</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">s3</span><span class="pun">)</span></li><li class="L2"><span class="pln">wait</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">s1</span><span class="pun">)</span></li><li class="L3"><span class="kwd">print</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="str">"3"</span><span class="pun">)</span></li><li class="L4"><span class="pln">signal</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">s1</span><span class="pun">)</span></li><li class="L5"><span class="pln">signal</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">s3</span><span class="pun">)</span></li><li class="L6"><span class="pln">signal</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">s2</span><span class="pun">)</span></li></ol></pre> <p>Unfortunately, the professor forgot to assign initial values to semaphores \\(\\textsf{s1, s2, and s3.}\\)<br/> <br/> For which values of \\(\\textsf{s1, s2, and s3}\\) will there be NO deadlock possible? </p> <p></p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
        `\\(\\text{s1 = 1, s2 = 1, s3 = 1}\\)`,
        `\\(\\text{s1 = 2, s2 = 1, s3 = 1}\\)`,
        `\\(\\text{s1 = 1, s2 = 2, s3 = 1}\\)`,
        `\\(\\text{s1 = 1, s2 = 1, s3 = 2}\\)`,
      ],
      answer: ["B"],
      solution: `<img src='js/questions/fst-mock-test-2/64.png' alt='solution' style='max-width:100%; border-radius: 8px;'>`
    },
    {
      marks: 2,
      neg: 0.67,
      type: "MCQ",
      text: `<p></p> <p>Let \\(n\\) be the number of real roots of function \\(f(x)=x^3+3 x+1\\). What is the value of \\(n?\\) </p> <p></p>`,
      image: "",
