      text: `<p></p> <p>I have just arrived by plane at Pittsburgh International Airport and I have forgotten where I have parked my car. There are n cars in the parking lot. I decide to look for my car with a simple serial search, examining, one by one, each and every car in the lot. This algorithm could be analyzed by considering its best case, average case, and worst case. Circle each of the following answers that are mathematically correct.</p> <p></p>`,
