        `\\( D(x, j) = D(x - a_j, j - 1) + D(x - a_j, j) \\)`,
        `\\( D(x, j) = D(x, j - 1) - D(x - a_j, j - 1) \\)`,
      ],
      answer: "B",
      solution: `<img src='js/questions/fst-mock-test-3/32.png' alt='solution' style='max-width:100%; border-radius: 8px;'>`
