      text: `<p> <meta/> </p> <div style="font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; font-size:1.05em; line-height:1.7; color:#222;"> <p>An entrance examination was prepared with \\(25\\) multiple-choice questions, each with \\(5\\) alternatives. In each question, at most one alternative can be selected, and leaving a question unanswered is also considered a possible way of answering. The number of candidates who took the exam was \\(63,127.\\) Consider the statement: </p> <p>“At least two candidates answered the first <span> \\(k\\) </span> questions of the exam in an identical way.”</p> <p>What is the largest value of <span> \\(k\\) </span> for which we can guarantee that the statement is true?</p> </div> <p></p>`,
