      text: `<p></p> <p>Let \\(\\text{L}\\) be a lattice \\([\\text{S},\\#],\\) where \\(\\text{S}\\) is the base set and \\(\\#\\) is a relation defined on \\(\\text{S}.\\) If for every subset \\(\\text{A}\\) of \\(\\text{S}, [\\text{A},\\#]\\) is also a lattice then \\(\\text{L}\\) must be? </p> <p></p>`,
