      text: `<p></p> <p>Let \\(\\Sigma=\\{a, b\\}\\). For a word \\(w \\in \\Sigma^{*}\\), let \\(n_{a}(x)\\) denote the number of \\(a\\)'s in \\(w\\) and let \\(n_{b}(x)\\) denote the number of \\(b\\)'s in \\(w\\). Consider the following language:<br/><span class="mjx-chtml MJXc-display" style="text-align: center;"></span> \$\$ L:=\\left\\{x y \\mid x, y \\in \\Sigma^{*}, n_{a}(x)=n_{b}(y)\\right\\} \$\$ <br/>What can we say about \\(L\\) ? (Select all that apply) </p> <p></p>`,
