      type: "MCQ",
      text: `<p></p> <p>Let \\(A=\\left\\langle a_{1} a_{0}\\right\\rangle\\) and \\(B=\\left\\langle b_{1} b_{0}\\right\\rangle\\) be two 2-bit numbers and \\(C=\\left\\langle c_{3} c_{2} c_{1} c_{0}\\right\\rangle\\) be a 4 -bit number, where \\(c_{0}=a_{0}, c_{1}=a_{1} \\oplus b_{0}\\), \\(c_{2}=b_{1} \\oplus a_{1} b_{0}\\), and \\(c_{3}=a_{1} b_{0} b_{1}\\) (' \\(\\oplus\\) ' denotes the XOR operation). If \\(X+Y\\) and \\(X Y\\) denote the arithmetic sum and product (of \\(X\\) and \\(Y\\) ) respectively, which of the following is true? </p> <p></p>`,
