      marks: 2,
      neg: 0.67,
      type: "MCQ",
      text: `<p></p> <p>Consider a CPU using a \\(5 -\\)stage pipeline structure (IF, ID, EX, MEM, WB) with separate data and instruction memories, no data forwarding mechanism, writing to the register bank on the rising edge of the clock and reading on the falling edge of the clock, and the following set of instructions: </p> <pre class="prettyprint linenums lang-text prettyprinted" data-pbcklang="text" data-pbcktabsize="4" style=""><ol class="linenums"><li class="L0"><span class="pln">I1</span><span class="pun">:</span><span class="pln"> lw   \$2</span><span class="pun">,</span><span class="pln"> </span><span class="lit">100</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">\$5</span><span class="pun">)</span></li><li class="L1"><span class="pln">I2</span><span class="pun">:</span><span class="pln"> </span><span class="kwd">add</span><span class="pln">  \$1</span><span class="pun">,</span><span class="pln"> \$2</span><span class="pun">,</span><span class="pln"> \$3</span></li><li class="L2"><span class="pln">I3</span><span class="pun">:</span><span class="pln"> </span><span class="kwd">sub</span><span class="pln">  \$3</span><span class="pun">,</span><span class="pln"> \$2</span><span class="pun">,</span><span class="pln"> \$1</span></li><li class="L3"><span class="pln">I4</span><span class="pun">:</span><span class="pln"> sw   \$2</span><span class="pun">,</span><span class="pln"> </span><span class="lit">50</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">\$1</span><span class="pun">)</span></li><li class="L4"><span class="pln">I5</span><span class="pun">:</span><span class="pln"> </span><span class="kwd">add</span><span class="pln">  \$2</span><span class="pun">,</span><span class="pln"> \$3</span><span class="pun">,</span><span class="pln"> \$3</span></li><li class="L5"><span class="pln">I6</span><span class="pun">:</span><span class="pln"> </span><span class="kwd">sub</span><span class="pln">  \$2</span><span class="pun">,</span><span class="pln"> \$2</span><span class="pun">,</span><span class="pln"> \$4</span></li></ol></pre> <p><br/>Each stage takes exactly one clock cycle to complete. How many clock cycles are required for the execution of this code?</p> <p></p>`,
