    },
    {
      marks: 2,
      neg: 0,
      type: "NAT",
      text: `<p> <meta/> </p> <p style="line-height:1.7;">A Depth First Search (DFS) is performed on a graph with vertices \\(\\{A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, I, J, K, L\\}\\). </p> <p style="line-height:1.7;">The vertices listed in increasing order of their discovery times are:</p> <p style="line-height:1.7;"> \\(A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, I, J, K, L\\) </p> <p style="line-height:1.7;">The vertices listed in increasing order of their finish times are:</p> <p style="line-height:1.7;"> \\(C, D, E, B, H, I, G, F, A, K, L, J\\) </p> <p style="line-height:1.7;">Based on the above DFS information, the number of connected components in the graph is ________.</p> <p></p>`,
      image: "",
